# A/B Testing Platform for SaaS

> **Stack**: Next.js 16 + Proxy (`proxy.ts`, called middleware before v16) + GA4/GTM + Supabase + Rust-WASM (for stats)
> **Why DIY?**: Google Optimize sunset Sept 2023. GA4 has no native A/B testing.

## Quick Start

```tsx
// proxy.ts - Server-side assignment (no flicker)
// Next.js 16 renamed middleware.ts / middleware() to proxy.ts / proxy()
import { NextResponse, type NextRequest } from 'next/server'

export function proxy(request: NextRequest) {
  let variant: string | undefined
  if (!request.cookies.get('exp_hero')) {
    variant = Math.random() < 0.5 ? 'A' : 'B'
    // Also put it on the request so every reader of THIS request sees it
    // (route handlers, Pages Router, cookies() on Next <=14.2.7); else a first visit
    // assigned B can render A
    request.cookies.set('exp_hero', variant)
  }

  const response = NextResponse.next({ request: { headers: request.headers } })
  if (variant) {
    response.cookies.set('exp_hero', variant, { maxAge: 60*60*24*30, path: '/' })
  }
  return response
}
```

